<!-- pages/about/about.wxml -->
<view class="page about-page">
  <view class="card about-hero">
    <text class="h1 about-name">{{appName}}</text>
    <text class="body-sm text-secondary about-intro">{{intro}}</text>
    <view class="flex-between about-version-row">
      <text class="caption text-tertiary">版本号</text>
      <text class="caption text-secondary">{{version}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 协议入口：分别跳转 ?type=user / ?type=privacy -->
  <view class="menu-list card">
    <view class="menu-item" data-type="user" bindtap="onGoAgreement">
      <text>用户协议</text>
      <text class="menu-item__arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="menu-item" data-type="privacy" bindtap="onGoAgreement">
      <text>隐私政策</text>
      <text class="menu-item__arrow">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="h4" style="display:block;margin-bottom:12rpx;">联系我们</text>
    <view class="flex-between">
      <text class="body-sm text-secondary">联系邮箱</text>
      <text class="body-sm">{{email}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card card--muted">
    <text class="caption text-secondary">
      本页中标注为【待补充】的信息（如运营主体、联系邮箱等）将在正式上线前由运营方补全。
    </text>
  </view>
</view>
